can’t pass a proof through. The host checks the device’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"proof, and the device checks the host’s before it saves anything."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Admission","anchor":"Admission","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before any key is seen, "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireAdmission","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" limits who reaches a handshake at the helper’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listener, and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireOrigin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" turns away connections from origins the helper doesn’t serve, such"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a VPN. Both are defence in depth; pairing is the boundary.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireMessage","doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireMessageKind","doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireHeader","doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireProtocol","doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/WireVersion"],"generated":true}],"references":{"doc://HeadwireWire/documentation/HeadwireWire/Hello":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/headwirewire\/hello","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The first message of every session connection, before anything else; never on a pairing connection."}],"title":"Hello","identifier":"doc:\/\/HeadwireWire\/documentation\/HeadwireWire\/Hello","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Hello","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hello","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://HeadwireWire/documentation/HeadwireWire/WireMessage":{"